  "content": {
    "id": "p10-q21-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "21",
    "prompt": "In an arithmetic sequence we are given that\n$$\\begin{aligned}a_1+a_3+a_5+\\cdots+a_9&=850,\\\\a_2+a_4+a_6+\\cdots+a_{10}&=1000.\\end{aligned}$$\nFind the common difference of this arithmetic sequence.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$d=30$.",
      "worked": "Let $d$ be the common difference. Each even-indexed term is $d$ greater than the preceding odd-indexed term.\n$$\\begin{align*}1000&=a_2+a_4+\\cdots+a_{10}\\\\1000&=(a_1+d)+(a_3+d)+(a_5+d)+(a_7+d)+(a_9+d)\\\\1000&=(a_1+a_3+a_5+a_7+a_9)+5d\\\\1000&=850+5d\\\\5d&=150\\\\d&=30.\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
    "answerSpaceMm": 49
  },
